{"id":"vod_hh_77342","vodId":"77342","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"尸鬼","name_cn":"尸鬼","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第22集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/a236d3f651b6736c17ae3d4b55e63697.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一个与世隔绝的村庄——外场村。多年以来，村庄一直维持着最为古老的殡葬方式——土葬。这为一种名叫“尸鬼”的怪物的生成提供了得天独厚的良好环境。尸鬼，僵尸的一种，它们身强体壮但惧怕阳光，靠吸食人类血液为生，同时以将普通的人类变成尸鬼来扩充己方的实力，它们的目的只有一个，那就是彻底占领外场村。奇怪的事情在村子各处隐秘的发生着，谁也没有将它们联系到一起，当恐惧爆发的时候，一切都已经为时已晚。结城夏野（内山昂辉 配音）是第一个发现尸鬼存在的人，而当他被尸鬼攻击后，却变成尸鬼的亚种“人狼”，人狼除了身体素质强于常人外，与人类无异，因此，人狼成为了唯一能够和尸鬼抗衡的存在。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-04-03 15:42:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKj0oxe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepvEppb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejmxjvd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepvEpVb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejmxjPd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6qglRa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZB3K5e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQpQx9e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penqBqWd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVxYMvb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/neloz4rd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DbDLzLyb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb2m3B1a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZB3MRe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aMlMlOe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKj0qYe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YerxJ4